    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Email Enquiries Only\n\nNew to the rental market, this luxury four bed detached dormer bungalow is ideally situated in a peaceful rural setting in County Carlow, while still offering excellent accessibility. The residence is approximately a five minute drive from the M9 motorway and just 10 minutes from Carlow Town.\n\nThis spacious and well maintained residence offers generous accommodation throughout.\n\nGround Floor Accommodation:\nSitting room with stove\nDouble bedroom with ensuite\nSpacious open-plan kitchen, living and dining area\nSunroom\nLarge utility room\nToilet\nStorage room/workshop\n\nFirst Floor Accommodation:\nTwo large double bedrooms, both ensuite\nMain bathroom\nSingle bedroom/office\n\nOutside \nMature gardens"
      },
